Subject: [PATCH 1/2] apprt/embedded: match the existing free-text C ABI
Upstream-Commit: 4803d58bb4ea8d2a71ebc1e5239f09a060e9e7c3
Base-Commit: 332b2aefc6e72d363aa93ab6ecfc86eeeeb5ed28 (v1.3.1)

Exact one-line upstream backport. The C header already takes a surface and
text pointer; accepting both arguments prevents freeing the surface as text.
No C header changes. Ghostty's MIT license applies.

diff --git a/src/apprt/embedded.zig b/src/apprt/embedded.zig
--- a/src/apprt/embedded.zig
+++ b/src/apprt/embedded.zig
@@ -1675,7 +1675,7 @@
         return true;
     }
 
-    export fn ghostty_surface_free_text(ptr: *Text) void {
+    export fn ghostty_surface_free_text(_: *Surface, ptr: *Text) void {
         ptr.deinit();
     }
 
